WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:09.080
The world is full of secret, underground societies,
that operate in the shadows and meet behind

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:12.400
closed doors, in windowless rooms.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:16.280
Some believe these societies are secretly
running the world.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:24.499
Let's find out more about the organisations
that don't want to be found out.

00:00:24.499 --> 00:00:28.329
1.

00:00:28.329 --> 00:00:36.020
The Skull and Bones order is senior secret
society at Yale University in Connecticut,

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:38.560
it's members are called Bonesmen.

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:44.250
It was founded in 1832 and is still running
today.

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:49.260
Membership is restricted to only a few highly
elite individuals.

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:54.989
Members meet every Thursday and Sunday of
each week in a building called The Tomb.

00:00:54.989 --> 00:00:59.930
Both of the Bush presidents were members of
the Skull and Bones society whilst studying

00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:00.930
at Yale.

00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:06.330
And the majority of its other members have
gone on to achieve great fame and fortune.

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:09.410
Numerous conspiracy theories surround the
group.

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:13.080
Some believe they are the American branch
of the infamous illuminati.

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:19.190
But the most popular theory is that the CIA
was formed by members from the Skull and Bones

00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:23.850
society and that they still control the CIA
to this day.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:24.850
2.

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:31.400
Next up is the Bilderberg Group, the name
for a secretive annual conference of approximately

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:39.180
150 highly influential individuals, membership
is strictly by invitation only.

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:44.800
Consisting of mostly prime ministers and presidents
from the most powerful countries in Europe

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:49.790
and North America, these make up two thirds
of the club's membership.

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:55.620
The other third of the members are said to
be major international bankers and media moguls.

00:01:55.620 --> 00:02:02.030
The club meets every year at secretive locations
around Europe and America, what the group

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:08.840
discusses is kept top secret, but is believed
that they discuss how countries and major

00:02:08.840 --> 00:02:14.519
organisations can better work together to
improve their economics and defence systems.

00:02:14.519 --> 00:02:20.569
In other words they discuss how to run the
world more economically and efficiently.

00:02:20.569 --> 00:02:25.180
Because of the secrecy of the group and the
high profiles of its members, the Bilderberg

00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:29.500
Group is surrounded by controversy and conspiracy
theories.

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:30.500
3.

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:36.430
The Freemasonry organisation is a deeply historic
fraternity that can trace its roots back to

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:40.739
stonemasons in the early 17th century.

00:02:40.739 --> 00:02:45.200
Freemasons meet regularly and are generally
focused on improving the lives of their members

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:52.060
and community, they also give heavily to charity,
despite this they are highly secretive.

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:57.840
Being such a historic organisation, Freemasons
perform various rituals during their meetings

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:05.150
and use secret signs and handshakes to recognise
fellow Masons.

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:10.030
Conspiracy theorists often link Freemasons
to groups such as the Illuminati, believing

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:13.939
that they are a contributing force to the
new world order.

00:03:13.939 --> 00:03:14.939
4.

00:03:14.939 --> 00:03:17.230
Next up is The Knight's Templar.

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:22.180
The Knight's Templar were a military order
setup by the Roman Catholic Church around

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:24.290
1129.

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:28.280
The group had a highly secretive initiation
ceremony.

00:03:28.280 --> 00:03:32.609
Commonly adorned in distinctive white mantles
with a red cross.

00:03:32.609 --> 00:03:38.379
They were the wealthiest and most skilled
fighters of all the Christian Crusades.

00:03:38.379 --> 00:03:43.830
There were also non combatant members of the
Knight's Templar who were in charge of managing

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:48.260
the large economic infrastructure throughout
Christendom.

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:54.799
The organisation created financial techniques
that were the earliest forms of banking.

00:03:54.799 --> 00:04:00.930
They also built many military fortifications
across Europe and the Holy Land.

00:04:00.930 --> 00:04:06.590
One of the most famous legends is that the
illustrious Holy Grail and possibly the Ark

00:04:06.590 --> 00:04:11.700
of the Covenant were discovered by the Knight's
Templar at Temple Mount.

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:12.700
5.

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:18.610
The Hashshashin were a mysterious group of
Muslim assassins that operated in the Middle

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:21.230
East during the 13th century.

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:27.330
The group was made up of Shia Muslims who
banded together in order to create a new utopian

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:28.330
state.

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:34.160
The group heavily used guerrilla tactics in
battles against their enemies, such as espionage,

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:37.870
sabotage and political assassination.

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:43.980
They worked by placing highly trained moles
inside enemy strongholds, and instructed to

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:47.250
only attack when the time was right.

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:52.540
It is reported that enemy leaders would awake
in the morning to find a Hashshashin dagger

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:58.000
lying on their pillow, along with a note saying
"you are in our grip."

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:01.350
The group became legendary contract killers.

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:07.590
Even performing jobs for high profile individuals
such as King Richard the Lionheart.

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:13.450
It is believed that the word "Hashshashin"
is where the modern word "assassin" comes

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:14.450
from.

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:15.450
6.

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:22.050
Founded in 1957, the Cadaver Society is a
secret society based at Washington and Lee

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:25.480
University in Lexington, Virginia.

00:05:25.480 --> 00:05:31.360
The group is extremely secretive and it's
membership and organisational structure are

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:32.360
unknown.

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:38.510
The society must be very wealthy because it
has made numerous, substantial donations to

00:05:38.510 --> 00:05:41.480
the University itself over the years.

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:46.750
It is rumoured that the Cadaver Society has
a network of underground passageways spanning

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:50.290
throughout the university campus.

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:56.420
It is believed the society uses these tunnels
to travel around the campus undetected.

00:05:56.420 --> 00:06:03.430
There are peculiar small locked doors all
across campus that seem to support this theory,

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:06.340
such as this one in the Leyburn Library.

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:10.580
Some believe the Cadaver Society to be a branch
of the Illuminati.

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:11.580
7.

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:17.380
Next up is the Hermetic Order of the Golden
Dawn, not the catchiest name for a secret

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:18.720
society.

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:24.310
They were devoted to the study and practice
of the occult, metaphysics and paranormal

00:06:24.310 --> 00:06:30.920
activity, and everything considered magical,
during the 19th and 20th centuries.

00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:37.180
The order has been one of the single biggest
influences on 20th century Western occultism,

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:38.350
such as Wicca.

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:39.350
8.

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:44.870
Another infamous occultist organisation is
the Ordo Templi Orientis.

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:51.250
It is an international fraternal and religious
society, founded at the begging of the 20th

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:52.250
century.

00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:57.950
It is dedicated to the Law of Thelema, which
was developed by the well known British writer

00:06:57.950 --> 00:07:04.140
and occultist Aleister Crowley, who went by
the nickname of "Great Beast".

00:07:04.140 --> 00:07:09.620
The organisation uses highly stylised rituals
for initiation.

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:15.050
During their meetings many Ancient Egyptian
Gods are invoked, as well as the Devil.

00:07:15.050 --> 00:07:20.240
They are known for sometimes performing their
rituals completely naked.

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:26.960
The Ordo Templi Orientis claims to have over
3,000 members worldwide.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:27.960
9.

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:35.710
Rosicrucianism is a philosophical secret society
founded in late medieval Germany around the

00:07:35.710 --> 00:07:37.950
16th century.

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:45.460
Rosicrucians opposed Roman Catholicism, rejecting
the idea of Dogma and instead relying on evidence

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:48.590
and experience to form conclusions.

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:53.680
It is believed that the Rosicrucians were
one of the biggest influences on the creation

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:55.280
of Freemasonry.

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:59.210
It is also rumoured that Isaac Newton was
a member.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:00.210
10.

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:03.760
And finally, is of course, the Illuminati.

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:08.870
Originally known as the Bavarian Illuminati,
they are a secretive group formed during the

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:13.790
age of enlightenment, on May 1st, 1776.

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:19.890
The Illuminati's original goals were to oppose
and put an end to superstition and religious

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:22.670
influence over public life.

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:27.150
They encouraged people to think for themselves
instead of doing what the state and their

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:29.470
religion tells them to do.

00:08:29.470 --> 00:08:33.260
The Illuminati is made up of mostly atheists.

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:39.750
Naturally the Roman Catholic Church didn't
take too kindly to the formation of the group.

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:48.220
So in 1784 the illuminati, along with freemasonry
were outlawed by the Bavarian leader Charles

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:53.819
Theodore, with the encouragement of the Roman
Catholic Church.

00:08:53.819 --> 00:08:58.950
However this didn't perturb the Illuminati,
they continued their meetings and pushing

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:03.540
their ideologies, but now all done in top
secret.

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:09.089
It is thought that, operating in the shadows,
and from behind closed doors, the Illuminati

00:09:09.089 --> 00:09:12.820
were responsible for the French Revolution.

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:19.110
It is thought by scholars that the Illuminati
collapsed entirely in the late 1700s.

00:09:19.110 --> 00:09:24.379
But some believe they are still very active
to this day.

00:09:24.379 --> 00:09:30.379
And is secretly operating and managing the
major governments of the world and they seek

00:09:30.379 --> 00:09:40.059
to create a One World Government based on
humanist and atheist principles.

